---
import Icon from "./Icon.astro";
---

<section class="sec" id="you">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="rv" style="text-align:center">
      <div class="label">What you do</div>
      <h2 class="h2">Three things are yours. Agents do the rest.</h2>
      <p class="sub" style="margin:0 auto">
        Run eight agents at once without watching eight terminals.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="calls">
      <div class="call rv">
        <div class="illo" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="prompt">
            <Icon icon="bot" class="s13" style="color: var(--st-investigate)" />
            <span class="typed">Why is checkout slow? Make tickets</span>
            <span class="cur"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="mini m1">
            <span class="k2">SHOP-35</span>Fetch carrier quotes in parallel
            <span class="by">
              <Icon icon="bot" class="s12" />
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="mini m2">
            <span class="k2">SHOP-36</span>Cache shipping quotes
            <span class="by">
              <Icon icon="bot" class="s12" />
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="mini m3">
            <span class="k2">SHOP-37</span>Load reviews after paint
            <span class="by">
              <Icon icon="bot" class="s12" />
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="call-b">
          <span class="k">01</span>
          <h3>Say what you want</h3>
          <p>
            The Project agent reads your code and writes the tickets. Or it runs your own import skill on your
            tracker.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="call rv">
        <div class="illo" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="inb">
            <Icon icon="inbox" class="s13" />
            Needs you<span class="bd">1</span>
          </div>
          <div class="askc">
            <span class="pill p-a">
              <Icon icon="message-q" />
              Asks you
            </span>
            <span class="q">No text given: open $EDITOR, or fail with a usage message?</span>
            <span class="o pick">1 · Open $EDITOR</span>
            <span class="o">2 · Fail with a usage message</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="call-b">
          <span class="k">02</span>
          <h3>Answer when asked</h3>
          <p>Stuck agents turn turquoise and land in one inbox. Everything else stays quiet.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="call rv">
        <div class="illo" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="diffc" style="margin-bottom:40px">
            <div class="h">@@ src/cli.js</div>
            <div class="d">- console.log(`$&#123;note.id&#125; $&#123;note.text&#125;`);</div>
            <div class="a">+ const id = dim(note.id);</div>
            <div class="a">+ console.log(`$&#123;id&#125; $&#123;note.text&#125;`);</div>
            <div class="h">@@ README.md</div>
            <div class="a">+ Set NO_COLOR to turn colors off.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="apv">
            <span class="pill p-ok merged">
              <Icon icon="git-merge" />
              Merged
            </span>
            <span class="btn btn-p">
              <Icon icon="check" class="s13" />
              Approve
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="call-b">
          <span class="k">03</span>
          <h3>Approve the diff</h3>
          <p>Review like a pull request, already checked by a second agent. Merge locally or open a PR.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="also rv">
      <span>
        <Icon icon="folder-git-2" />
        One worktree per ticket
      </span>
      <span>
        <Icon icon="workflow" />
        Dependencies run in order
      </span>
      <span>
        <Icon icon="layers" />
        Epics with a lead agent
      </span>
      <span>
        <Icon icon="terminal" />
        Real terminals you can type into
      </span>
      <span>
        <Icon icon="server" />
        Keeps running with the window closed
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
